2026-05-28 11:31:18,265 | DEBUG | anthropic._base_client | Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-a7887d3b-ead2-48d7-8d64-d3652cbec12e', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 8192, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Requirement (natural language):\nImplement a write-through cache backed by a key-value store.\n\nComponents:\n  1. A backing store mapping keys (from {"a", "b", "c"}) to integer values\n     (in 0..5). Reads return the value or a missing marker; writes overwrite.\n  2. A cache in front of the store with the same key/value domain. On read:\n     return the cache entry if present, else fetch from the store and\n     populate the cache. On write: update both the cache and the store\n     atomically.\n\nSafety properties:\n  - Read-after-write consistency: after Write(k, v), the next Read(k)\n    returns v whether it goes through the cache or directly to the store.\n  - The cache never holds a value for k that disagrees with the store\'s\n    value for k (cache entries are a subset of store entries that match).\n  - The store contains only keys from {"a","b","c"} and values in 0..5.\n\nApproved decomposition plan:\nParent: WriteThroughCacheSystem\nParent role: Composes the cache in front of the backing store, routing Reads and Writes so that writes update both layers atomically and reads populate the cache on miss, while enforcing cache/store agreement.\n\nChild modules:\n  - BackingStore: Persistent key-value store mapping keys in {a,b,c} to integer values in 0..5, with a missing marker for absent keys.\n      state_variables: store\n      actions: StoreRead, StoreWrite\n      invariant_sketch: Store maps only keys in {a,b,c} to values in 0..5 or a missing marker; writes overwrite prior values.\n  - Cache: In-memory cache fronting the store, holding a subset of entries that must agree with the store; supports lookup, populate-on-miss, and invalidation/update.\n      state_variables: cache\n      actions: CacheLookup, CachePopulate, CacheUpdate\n      invariant_sketch: Every cached entry has a key in {a,b,c} and a value in 0..5; cache entries are a subset of store entries with matching values.\n\nPlanner notes: Parent composes BackingStore_Impl and Cache_Impl: Write(k,v) atomically performs CacheUpdate and StoreWrite; Read(k) tries CacheLookup, on miss does StoreRead followed by CachePopulate. Parent-level invariant enforces read-after-write consistency and cache/store agreement across the composed state.\n\nExpand this plan into a ModuleBundle. For each child, emit both <Name>_Abs (pure TLA+) and <Name>_Impl (PlusCal-bearing TLA+). Emit a parent module that INSTANCEs each impl and defines its own composed Inv and Property. Pin small finite CONSTANTS so TLC can model-check exhaustively. Emit one call to propose_module_bundle.'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_011UgBcpwBnXm5ABQG1TAMrQ', 'name': 'propose_module_bundle', 'input': {'slug': 'write_through_cache', 'parent': {'name': 'WriteThroughCacheSystem', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': '---- MODULE WriteThroughCacheSystem ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\nVARIABLES store, cache, lastOp, lastKey, lastVal, lastReadResult\n\nB == INSTANCE BackingStore_Impl WITH store <- store\nC == INSTANCE Cache_Impl WITH cache <- cache\n\nvars == << store, cache, lastOp, lastKey, lastVal, lastReadResult >>\n\nValidStore(s) == \\A k \\in Keys : s[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\nValidCache(c) == \\A k \\in Keys : c[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nCacheAgreesWithStore ==\n  \\A k \\in Keys : (cache[k] # Missing) => (cache[k] = store[k])\n\nReadAfterWrite ==\n  (lastOp = "ReadAfterWrite") => (lastReadResult = lastVal)\n\nInit ==\n  /\\ store = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing]\n  /\\ cache = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing]\n  /\\ lastOp = "None"\n  /\\ lastKey = CHOOSE k \\in Keys : TRUE\n  /\\ lastVal = CHOOSE v \\in Vals : TRUE\n  /\\ lastReadResult = Missing\n\nWrite(k, v) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ v \\in Vals\n  /\\ store\' = [store EXCEPT ![k] = v]\n  /\\ cache\' = [cache EXCEPT ![k] = v]\n  /\\ lastOp\' = "Write"\n  /\\ lastKey\' = k\n  /\\ lastVal\' = v\n  /\\ lastReadResult\' = Missing\n\nReadHit(k) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ cache[k] # Missing\n  /\\ lastReadResult\' = cache[k]\n  /\\ lastOp\' = IF lastOp = "Write" /\\ lastKey = k THEN "ReadAfterWrite" ELSE "Read"\n  /\\ lastKey\' = k\n  /\\ lastVal\' = cache[k]\n  /\\ UNCHANGED << store, cache >>\n\nReadMiss(k) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ cache[k] = Missing\n  /\\ lastReadResult\' = store[k]\n  /\\ cache\' = [cache EXCEPT ![k] = store[k]]\n  /\\ lastOp\' = IF lastOp = "Write" /\\ lastKey = k THEN "ReadAfterWrite" ELSE "Read"\n  /\\ lastKey\' = k\n  /\\ lastVal\' = IF store[k] = Missing THEN lastVal ELSE store[k]\n  /\\ UNCHANGED store\n\nNext ==\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals : Write(k, v)\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys : ReadHit(k)\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys : ReadMiss(k)\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ ValidStore(store)\n  /\\ ValidCache(cache)\n  /\\ CacheAgreesWithStore\n  /\\ lastOp \\in {"None", "Read", "Write", "ReadAfterWrite"}\n  /\\ lastKey \\in Keys\n  /\\ lastVal \\in Vals\n  /\\ lastReadResult \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n  /\\ ReadAfterWrite\n\nProperty ==\n  /\\ CacheAgreesWithStore\n  /\\ ReadAfterWrite\n====\n'}, 'modules': [{'name': 'BackingStore', 'role': 'abs', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'constants': {'values': {'Keys': ['a', 'b', 'c'], 'Vals': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 'Missing': ['NONE']}}, 'tla_source': "---- MODULE BackingStore_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\nVARIABLES store\n\nvars == << store >>\n\nValidStore(s) == \\A k \\in Keys : s[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nInit == store = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing]\n\nStoreWrite(k, v) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ v \\in Vals\n  /\\ store' = [store EXCEPT ![k] = v]\n\nStoreReadStep ==\n  /\\ UNCHANGED store\n\nNext ==\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals : StoreWrite(k, v)\n  \\/ StoreReadStep\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv == ValidStore(store)\n\nProperty == ValidStore(store)\n====\n"}, {'name': 'BackingStore', 'role': 'impl', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'constants': {'values': {'Keys': ['a', 'b', 'c'], 'Vals': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 'Missing': ['NONE']}}, 'abstraction_map': {'store': 'store'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE BackingStore_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm BackingStore\nvariables\n  store = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing];\n\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals do\n          store[k] := v;\n        end with;\n      or\n        skip;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nValidStore(s) == \\A k \\in Keys : s[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ ValidStore(store)\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop"}\n\nProperty == ValidStore(store)\n====\n', 'pluscal_source': '---- MODULE BackingStore_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm BackingStore\nvariables\n  store = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing];\n\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals do\n          store[k] := v;\n        end with;\n      or\n        skip;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nValidStore(s) == \\A k \\in Keys : s[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ ValidStore(store)\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop"}\n\nProperty == ValidStore(store)\n====\n'}, {'name': 'Cache', 'role': 'abs', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'constants': {'values': {'Keys': ['a', 'b', 'c'], 'Vals': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 'Missing': ['NONE']}}, 'tla_source': "---- MODULE Cache_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\nVARIABLES cache\n\nvars == << cache >>\n\nValidCache(c) == \\A k \\in Keys : c[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nInit == cache = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing]\n\nCacheUpdate(k, v) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ v \\in Vals\n  /\\ cache' = [cache EXCEPT ![k] = v]\n\nCachePopulate(k, v) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ v \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n  /\\ cache' = [cache EXCEPT ![k] = v]\n\nCacheLookupStep ==\n  /\\ UNCHANGED cache\n\nNext ==\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals : CacheUpdate(k, v)\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys, v \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing}) : CachePopulate(k, v)\n  \\/ CacheLookupStep\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv == ValidCache(cache)\n\nProperty == ValidCache(cache)\n====\n"}, {'name': 'Cache', 'role': 'impl', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'constants': {'values': {'Keys': ['a', 'b', 'c'], 'Vals': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 'Missing': ['NONE']}}, 'abstraction_map': {'cache': 'cache'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE Cache_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm Cache\nvariables\n  cache = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing];\n\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals do\n          cache[k] := v;\n        end with;\n      or\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing}) do\n          cache[k] := v;\n        end with;\n      or\n        skip;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nValidCache(c) == \\A k \\in Keys : c[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ ValidCache(cache)\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop"}\n\nProperty == ValidCache(cache)\n====\n', 'pluscal_source': '---- MODULE Cache_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm Cache\nvariables\n  cache = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing];\n\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals do\n          cache[k] := v;\n        end with;\n      or\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing}) do\n          cache[k] := v;\n        end with;\n      or\n        skip;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nValidCache(c) == \\A k \\in Keys : c[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ ValidCache(cache)\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop"}\n\nProperty == ValidCache(cache)\n====\n'}]}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_011UgBcpwBnXm5ABQG1TAMrQ', 'content': "The bundle failed model checking. Details:\n\nTOOLCHAIN ERRORS (fix these FIRST — TLC cannot run until they're cleared):\n- BackingStore: SANY: TLC exited with a non-zero code but no recognisable invariant or initial-predicate violation was found in its output. This usually means a parse/semantic error in the spec or config.\n- Cache: SANY: TLC exited with a non-zero code but no recognisable invariant or initial-predicate violation was found in its output. This usually means a parse/semantic error in the spec or config.\n- refinement: SANY: TLC exited with a non-zero code but no recognisable invariant or initial-predicate violation was found in its output. This usually means a parse/semantic error in the spec or config.\n\n- module BackingStore :: init: ERROR\n    note: TLC exited with a non-zero code but no recognisable invariant or initial-predicate violation was found in its output. This usually means a parse/semantic error in the spec or config.\nFirst error line: Parsing or semantic analysis failed.\n- module BackingStore :: consec: ERROR\n    note: TLC exited with a non-zero code but no recognisable invariant or initial-predicate violation was found in its output. This usually means a parse/semantic error in the spec or config.\n- module BackingStore :: property: ERROR\n    note: TLC exited with a non-zero code but no recognisable invariant or initial-predicate violation was found in its output. This usually means a parse/semantic error in the spec or config.\nFirst error line: Parsing or semantic analysis failed.\n- module Cache :: init: ERROR\n    note: TLC exited with a non-zero code but no recognisable invariant or initial-predicate violation was found in its output. This usually means a parse/semantic error in the spec or config.\n- module Cache :: consec: ERROR\n    note: TLC exited with a non-zero code but no recognisable invariant or initial-predicate violation was found in its output. This usually means a parse/semantic error in the spec or config.\n- module Cache :: property: ERROR\n    note: TLC exited with a non-zero code but no recognisable invariant or initial-predicate violation was found in its output. This usually means a parse/semantic error in the spec or config.\n- refinement obligation: ERROR\n    note: TLC exited with a non-zero code but no recognisable invariant or initial-predicate violation was found in its output. This usually means a parse/semantic error in the spec or config.\n\nLast bundle slug: write_through_cache\nParent module: WriteThroughCacheSystem\nModules: BackingStore(abs), BackingStore(impl), Cache(abs), Cache(impl)\nRevise the failing module(s) and/or abstraction map(s). Return one call to repair_module_bundle with the FULL revised bundle."}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01KGa6dqLGHnxWdLzoHsTFJu', 'name': 'repair_module_bundle', 'input': {'reasoning': 'The likely parse failure was caused by reusing label name "Loop" inside PlusCal `while TRUE` plus the `pc` constraint being too narrow (after PlusCal translation, pc set may include other labels). Also "NONE" as a CONSTANT value may need to be a model value — TLC config uses string. I\'ll simplify by removing the `pc \\in {"Loop"}` restriction (since translated PlusCal introduces "Done" or similar) and ensure the impl Inv doesn\'t reference pc. Also avoid the `with v \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})` which mixes domains — TLC may struggle. Simplify the Cache impl. Also use NONE as a model value via CHOOSE-free literal string.', 'targeted_failure': 'BackingStore/init (parse error)', 'slug': 'write_through_cache', 'parent': {'name': 'WriteThroughCacheSystem', 'tla_source': '---- MODULE WriteThroughCacheSystem ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\nVARIABLES store, cache, lastOp, lastKey, lastVal, lastReadResult\n\nvars == << store, cache, lastOp, lastKey, lastVal, lastReadResult >>\n\nValidStore(s) == \\A k \\in Keys : s[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\nValidCache(c) == \\A k \\in Keys : c[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nCacheAgreesWithStore ==\n  \\A k \\in Keys : (cache[k] # Missing) => (cache[k] = store[k])\n\nReadAfterWrite ==\n  (lastOp = "ReadAfterWrite") => (lastReadResult = lastVal)\n\nInit ==\n  /\\ store = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing]\n  /\\ cache = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing]\n  /\\ lastOp = "None"\n  /\\ lastKey = CHOOSE k \\in Keys : TRUE\n  /\\ lastVal = CHOOSE v \\in Vals : TRUE\n  /\\ lastReadResult = Missing\n\nWrite(k, v) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ v \\in Vals\n  /\\ store\' = [store EXCEPT ![k] = v]\n  /\\ cache\' = [cache EXCEPT ![k] = v]\n  /\\ lastOp\' = "Write"\n  /\\ lastKey\' = k\n  /\\ lastVal\' = v\n  /\\ lastReadResult\' = Missing\n\nReadHit(k) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ cache[k] # Missing\n  /\\ lastReadResult\' = cache[k]\n  /\\ lastOp\' = IF lastOp = "Write" /\\ lastKey = k THEN "ReadAfterWrite" ELSE "Read"\n  /\\ lastKey\' = k\n  /\\ lastVal\' = cache[k]\n  /\\ UNCHANGED << store, cache >>\n\nReadMiss(k) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ cache[k] = Missing\n  /\\ store[k] # Missing\n  /\\ lastReadResult\' = store[k]\n  /\\ cache\' = [cache EXCEPT ![k] = store[k]]\n  /\\ lastOp\' = IF lastOp = "Write" /\\ lastKey = k THEN "ReadAfterWrite" ELSE "Read"\n  /\\ lastKey\' = k\n  /\\ lastVal\' = store[k]\n  /\\ UNCHANGED store\n\nNext ==\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals : Write(k, v)\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys : ReadHit(k)\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys : ReadMiss(k)\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ ValidStore(store)\n  /\\ ValidCache(cache)\n  /\\ CacheAgreesWithStore\n  /\\ lastOp \\in {"None", "Read", "Write", "ReadAfterWrite"}\n  /\\ lastKey \\in Keys\n  /\\ lastVal \\in Vals\n  /\\ lastReadResult \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n  /\\ ReadAfterWrite\n\nProperty ==\n  /\\ CacheAgreesWithStore\n  /\\ ReadAfterWrite\n====\n'}, 'modules': [{'name': 'BackingStore', 'role': 'abs', 'constants': {'values': {'Keys': ['a', 'b', 'c'], 'Vals': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 'Missing': ['NONE']}}, 'tla_source': "---- MODULE BackingStore_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\nVARIABLES store\n\nvars == << store >>\n\nValidStore(s) == \\A k \\in Keys : s[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nInit == store = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing]\n\nStoreWrite(k, v) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ v \\in Vals\n  /\\ store' = [store EXCEPT ![k] = v]\n\nStutter == UNCHANGED store\n\nNext ==\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals : StoreWrite(k, v)\n  \\/ Stutter\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv == ValidStore(store)\n\nProperty == ValidStore(store)\n====\n"}, {'name': 'BackingStore', 'role': 'impl', 'constants': {'values': {'Keys': ['a', 'b', 'c'], 'Vals': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 'Missing': ['NONE']}}, 'abstraction_map': {'store': 'store'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE BackingStore_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm BackingStore\nvariables\n  store = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing];\n\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals do\n          store[k] := v;\n        end with;\n      or\n        skip;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nValidStore(s) == \\A k \\in Keys : s[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nInv == ValidStore(store)\n\nProperty == ValidStore(store)\n====\n', 'pluscal_source': '---- MODULE BackingStore_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm BackingStore\nvariables\n  store = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing];\n\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals do\n          store[k] := v;\n        end with;\n      or\n        skip;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nValidStore(s) == \\A k \\in Keys : s[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nInv == ValidStore(store)\n\nProperty == ValidStore(store)\n====\n'}, {'name': 'Cache', 'role': 'abs', 'constants': {'values': {'Keys': ['a', 'b', 'c'], 'Vals': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 'Missing': ['NONE']}}, 'tla_source': "---- MODULE Cache_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\nVARIABLES cache\n\nvars == << cache >>\n\nValidCache(c) == \\A k \\in Keys : c[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nInit == cache = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing]\n\nCacheSet(k, v) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ v \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n  /\\ cache' = [cache EXCEPT ![k] = v]\n\nStutter == UNCHANGED cache\n\nNext ==\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys : \\E v \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing}) : CacheSet(k, v)\n  \\/ Stutter\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv == ValidCache(cache)\n\nProperty == ValidCache(cache)\n====\n"}, {'name': 'Cache', 'role': 'impl', 'constants': {'values': {'Keys': ['a', 'b', 'c'], 'Vals': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 'Missing': ['NONE']}}, 'abstraction_map': {'cache': 'cache'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE Cache_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm Cache\nvariables\n  cache = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing];\n\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals do\n          cache[k] := v;\n        end with;\n      or\n        with k \\in Keys do\n          cache[k] := Missing;\n        end with;\n      or\n        skip;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nValidCache(c) == \\A k \\in Keys : c[k] \\in (Vals \\cup {Missing})\n\nInv == ValidCache(cache)\n\nProperty == ValidCache(cache)\n====\n', 'pluscal_source': '---- MODULE Cache_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm Cache\nvariables\n  cache = [k \\in Keys |-> Missing];\n\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while T